= Mark Rein

Mark Rein is a Socialist journalist for Novaya Zhizn, our party newspaper, and is also the son Rafail Abramovich. He breifly supported reconciliation with the Bolsheviks.

- @media_
- @faction_support_
- @rkp_cooperation
- @root: Return to main


@media_
title: Media
subtitle: Manage our party's newspapers and media.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media


@faction_support_
title: Editorial Line
subtitle: We can influence the editorial line of Novaya Zhizn to support a particular faction.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

Which faction should we support?

- @support_left: Mezhraiontsy
- @support_center: Mensheviks
- @support_labor: Trudoviks
- @support_reform: Yedinstvenny
- @support_neorev: Novomen'sheviki

@support_left
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; left_strength += 8

Novaya Zhizn prints editorials in support of Internationalist positions.

@support_center
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 8; center_strength += 8

Novaya Zhizn prints editorials in support of Centrist positions.

@support_labor
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 8

Novaya Zhizn prints editorials in support of the policies of the trade unions.

@support_reform
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 8; reformist_strength += 8;

Novaya Zhizn prints editorials in support of the reformist policies.

@support_neorev
view-if: neorevisionism
on-arrival: neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_strength += 8

Novaya Zhizn prints editorials in support of neorevisionist ideas.

@rkp_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the RKP
subtitle: Could we build closer ties with the RKP?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 2; rkp_relation += 4*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2

Rein works towards closer ties with the RKP through our media.
